# Runtime output dir — 12GB of DBs, media and MCP state captures, nothing
# tracked. The whole dir is ignored so stray runtime files (page snapshots,
# scratch dumps) can't slip into a commit; the entries below are the known
# offenders, kept for documentation.
src/mastra/public/
src/mastra/public/.playwright-mcp/
src/mastra/public/film-work/
src/mastra/public/film-output/
